This product bundles Git, the version control system (https://git-scm.com),
as built for macOS by dugite-native (https://github.com/desktop/dugite-native):
git 2.53.0 from the dugite-native v2.53.0-4 release, for arm64 and x86_64,
under Contents/Resources/git. Git is licensed under the GNU General Public
License, version 2 (https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html).
Its complete corresponding source is at https://github.com/git/git/tree/v2.53.0,
and the scripts that built these binaries are at
https://github.com/desktop/dugite-native/tree/v2.53.0-4. Git is a separate
program the app runs; it is not linked into Infinitary. The binaries are
shipped as that release built them, less the Git Credential Manager and
git-lfs programs it also carries.

